1
00:00:00,139 --> 00:00:04,509
Look, your problem is not Wil Wheaton.
Your problem is the way you treated Amy.

2
00:00:04,710 --> 00:00:07,110
(Sheldon:)Problem is I'm out of tea.

3
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:11,680
(Penny:)Come on, someone insulted your girlfriend,
you just let him do it?

4
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:14,510
(Penny:)Thought you Texas guys stood up
for your womenfolk.

5
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:16,350
Oh, Penny, please.

6
00:00:16,522 --> 00:00:19,612
(Sheldon:)Think I've evolved
beyond my simple rustic upbringing.

7
00:00:19,792 --> 00:00:20,852
(Amy:)Sorry.

8
00:00:21,026 --> 00:00:24,986
(Sheldon:)On the other hand, that low-down polecat
done wronged my woman.

9
00:00:28,133 --> 00:00:30,863
(Penny:)Welcome to Long Island, Tex.

10
00:00:32,271 --> 00:00:33,931
(Sheldon:)Amy deserves better.

11
00:00:34,106 --> 00:00:36,476
(Howard:)You know,
when we buy the Planters Deluxe Mix...

12
00:00:36,642 --> 00:00:39,942
(Sheldon:)...she eats all the Brazil nuts
so I don't have to look at them.

13
00:00:41,547 --> 00:00:44,447
(Sheldon:)She's a unique blend of saint and squirrel.

14
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:47,810
Yup, that she is. Here you go.

15
00:00:47,987 --> 00:00:51,517
(Sheldon:)I'm a callous egomaniac.
She's gonna leave me.

16
00:00:51,690 --> 00:01:03,020
- No, she won't.
- No, she won't. I'm great.

